## Architecture

This service follows the **golden path** established by the platform team:

| Layer | Technology |
|-------|-----------|
| Runtime | Node.js 20 LTS (Alpine) |
| Framework | Fastify (HTTP/JSON API) |
| Build | TypeScript 5.4+ |
| Container | Multi-stage → Distroless |
| CI/CD | GitHub Actions → ECR → ArgoCD |
| Observability | OpenTelemetry auto-instrumentation |
| Infra | Terraform (EKS namespace, IAM) |

## Directory Structure

```
.
├── src/                    # Application source code
│   ├── index.ts            # Entry point
│   └── routes/             # API route handlers
├── k8s-manifests/          # Kubernetes manifests (base + overlays)
├── terraform/              # Infrastructure module
├── .github/workflows/      # CI/CD pipelines
├── Dockerfile              # Multi-stage container build
├── catalog-info.yaml       # Backstage entity registration
└── Makefile                # Build/test/deploy targets
```

